{"about_the_game":"It was just another peaceful day for <strong>Kappa Yo</strong> and his pal <strong>Tanuki Jo</strong> when suddenly the evil <strong>Oni Shogun</strong> cracked open a portal from Oni World and invaded with his army of yokai! The yokai have kidnapped the princess and even pilfered Yo's stash of cucumbers, what a disaster! Now it\u2019s up to our heroes to defeat the Oni Shogun and his fiendish army, rescue the princess and take back their cucumbers.<br><br><strong>Kappa Quest</strong> is a fast-paced, retro-inspired action adventure through ancient Japan. Play as either Yo or Jo on a mission to defeat the army of yokai and save the day. Encounter challenging levels full of treacherous tricks and traps. Use Yo and Jo\u2019s special abilities to take down bosses and track down treasure.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2977060?t=1771757335","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2977060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771757335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2977060/99cf1bb88141b073474cdd3e4f2d66c960cd5c45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771757335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2977060/99cf1bb88141b073474cdd3e4f2d66c960cd5c45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771757335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"It was just another peaceful day for <strong>Kappa Yo</strong> and his pal <strong>Tanuki Jo</strong> when suddenly the evil <strong>Oni Shogun</strong> cracked open a portal from Oni World and invaded with his army of yokai! The yokai have kidnapped the princess and even pilfered Yo's stash of cucumbers, what a disaster! Now it\u2019s up to our heroes to defeat the Oni Shogun and his fiendish army, re